                        "username": "zoeychung10"
                    },
                    "message": "Hi @patrick@stwcx.xyz,\nCould you please help review this Gerrit change?\nThis change uses phosphor-settings to make the default value for the OEM meta get/set boot order command persistent across system reboots.\nAnd requires the following change to be merged first: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/80887"
                },
